###> symfony/asset-mapper ###
/public/assets/
# assets/vendor/ is COMMITTED (not ignored) on purpose: a CI `importmap:install`
# depends on jsDelivr, which cannot reliably bundle some packages as ESM (persistent
# 500) → an incomplete asset bundle used to ship (mikamiho.cz outage 2026-06-30).
# Vendoring makes the build offline + reproducible. Add/update a package LOCALLY
# with `bin/console importmap:require <pkg>` then commit assets/vendor/.
###< symfony/asset-mapper ###

